==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dark Explorers|Eevee|83}} from the {{TCG|Dark Explorers}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Eevee|70}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*'''Stampede''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Phanpy|62}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*'''Boosted Evolution''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Surging Sparks|Eevee|143}} from the {{TCG|Surging Sparks}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

